Package: cubrid-admin
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: CUBRID Corporation
Installed-Size: @SIZE_KB@
Section: database
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/CUBRID/cubrid-admin
Description: CUBRID Admin Server
 The web-based administration tool for CUBRID, run as the cubrid-admin
 systemd service. Settings: /etc/cubrid-admin/cwm.conf. Data:
 /var/lib/cubrid-admin. Logs: /var/log/cubrid-admin.
